#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/guide/install.md:1 docs/guide/install.md:5 messages/po4a/en.xml:618
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Deploy FreeAnima on your machine — from source, or with a Linux standalone executable.\n"
"> After install: [`security.md`](security.md) (credentials, bind address) · [`database.md`](database.md) (PostgreSQL) · [`service.md`](service.md) (runtime commands) · [`remote-access.md`](remote-access.md) (Service API Token / LAN).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/install.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a path"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Path           | Best for                                  | Bun on host | PostgreSQL  | Redis                  | Secrets                       |\n"
"| -------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ----------- | ----------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n"
"| **Source**     | Contributors, day-to-day development      | Required    | You install | Optional (recommended) | Vault / `env()` (recommended) |\n"
"| **Standalone** | Production / self-host without a checkout | Not needed  | You install | Optional (recommended) | Vault / `env()` (recommended) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:18
msgid ""
"Both paths run the same `anima service` runtime (Hub REST `/api` + Hub RPC `/"
"hub/rpc/v1` + engine). PostgreSQL with **pgvector** is **required**. Redis "
"powers EventBus and task context; it **degrades silently** when unavailable "
"— production setups should still run it."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/install.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shared prerequisites"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Component      | Version / notes                                                                                                        |\n"
"| -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Bun**        | >= 1.3.14 — required for **source** installs ([bun.sh](https://bun.sh)); not required for standalone binaries          |\n"
"| **PostgreSQL** | 17 recommended; extensions: `vector`, FTS helpers — see [`database.md`](database.md)                                   |\n"
"| **Redis**      | 7.x recommended; defaults to `127.0.0.1:6379` when configured                                                          |\n"
"| **Vault**      | Recommended — API keys and DB URLs stay out of config files ([`security.md`](security.md#credential-responsibilities)) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:29
msgid ""
"Data directory: `~/.anima/` (override with `FREEANIMA_HOME`). Back it up "
"with your database."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/install.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Standalone (Linux x64)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:35
msgid ""
"Release publishes 三端产物（与 canary 对称）：`anima-linux-x64.tar.gz`、"
"`freeanima-desktop-windows-x64-setup.exe`、`freeanima-mobile-android.apk`"
"（CI 固定 upload 签名；本地 `debug:android` 仍为默认 debug 签名）。"
"Standalone tarball 内含单文件可执行文件 `anima`；版本、service build-meta、"
"migrations 与 Web UI 均嵌入该二进制。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/install.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Install (recommended)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -fsSL https://freeanima.com/install | bash\n"
"anima --version   # e.g. 0.8.5 (standalone) · release\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:44
msgid "Canary（`main` 滚动 Pre-release tag `canary`）或 pin 版本："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -fsSL https://freeanima.com/install | CHANNEL=canary bash\n"
"curl -fsSL https://freeanima.com/install | VERSION=v0.8.5 bash\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:51
msgid ""
"国内网络可指定公共 GitHub 反代（`PROXY=none|ghproxy-net|gh-proxy-com|ghfast-"
"top`，默认 `none`）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -fsSL https://freeanima.com/install | PROXY=ghproxy-net bash\n"
"curl -fsSL https://freeanima.com/install | CHANNEL=canary PROXY=ghfast-top bash\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:58
msgid ""
"可选环境变量：`FREEANIMA_INSTALL_PREFIX`（默认 `~/.anima/standalone`）、"
"`FREEANIMA_HOME`（默认 `~/.anima`，决定 `bin` shim 位置）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:60
msgid "备用（不依赖站点发布）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/main/scripts/install.sh | bash\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:66
msgid ""
"Install prefix 只需要 **一个** `anima` 文件。Do not unpack into a git "
"checkout. Ensure `~/.anima/bin` is on `PATH`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:68
msgid "Manual unpack (same layout as the installer):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:69
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir -p ~/.anima/standalone && cd ~/.anima/standalone\n"
"tar -xzf /path/to/anima-linux-x64.tar.gz\n"
"mkdir -p ~/.anima/bin && ln -sf \"$PWD/anima\" ~/.anima/bin/anima\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:76
msgid ""
"Or from a checkout: `just install-cli` (builds then installs to the same "
"default prefix)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:78
msgid "Installed standalone 可用内置升级换轨："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:79
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima upgrade --channel canary   # 跟随 canary tip\n"
"anima upgrade --channel release  # 切回稳定轨 tip\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Mobile Android APK**（`freeanima-mobile-android.apk`）：从 GitHub Release（`canary` 或版本 tag）下载 sideload。CI 使用固定 upload 签名，同 channel 内可覆盖升级。若曾安装旧版未固定签名的包，或密钥轮换后，需先卸载 `FreeAnima`（`org.freeanima.app`）再安装。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/install.md:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Configure"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:88
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir -p ~/.anima\n"
"chmod 700 ~/.anima\n"
"# copy config.example.yaml from the repo, or write manually\n"
"cp /path/to/freeanima-checkout/config.example.yaml ~/.anima/config.yaml\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:96
msgid ""
"Minimum production settings in `~/.anima/config.yaml` (**bootstrap only**):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/install.md:99
msgid "**`database.url`** — PostgreSQL connection string (required)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/install.md:99
msgid ""
"**`web.enabled`** — Hub hosts `/web/*` when dist exists (optional; defaults "
"to on if omitted)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:101
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Runtime settings** (LLM providers, compression, MCP, etc.) are stored in PostgreSQL (`hub_runtime_config`). Edit them in the Shell app under **Settings → Hub 服务 → 服务配置**.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:103
msgid ""
"Prefer Vault or `env()` for secrets. See [`security.md`]"
"(security.md#credential-responsibilities)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/install.md:104
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Start the service"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:106
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima service start              # background (systemd user unit when available)\n"
"anima service start --foreground # debug — logs to stdout\n"
"anima service status\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:113
msgid ""
"Default bind: `127.0.0.1:2658`（Hub API：`/api`，Hub RPC：`/hub/rpc/v1`；Web "
"UI：`/web/*` when `config.yaml` `web.enabled`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/install.md:114
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Upgrade"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:117
msgid "Installed standalone (independent prefix, e.g. `~/.anima/standalone`):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:118
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima upgrade                 # 当前 bake channel 内升级（release：semver；canary：commit）\n"
"anima upgrade --check\n"
"anima upgrade --channel canary   # 切到 / 检查 canary tip\n"
"anima upgrade --proxy ghproxy-net\n"
"anima upgrade --check --channel canary --proxy ghfast-top\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:127
msgid ""
"升级时 Hub 在**下载与校验阶段保持在线**；若 service 原先在运行，仅在替换二进"
"制瞬间短暂停服并自动拉起。未运行 service 时仅覆盖 `prefix/anima`，不会自动启"
"动。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "anima service restart   # 手动升级二进制后若未自动拉起时使用\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:133
msgid ""
"Re-run the curl installer to reinstall/overwrite the same prefix, or from a "
"checkout rebuild and reinstall (never into the repo):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:134
#, no-wrap
msgid "just install-cli\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:139
msgid "`dist/anima-executable/` is build staging only — not a runtime prefix."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/install.md:140
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build from a checkout"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:143
msgid ""
"Always runs `build:web` before compiling the binary (embeds current Web "
"dist):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:144
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bun run build:cli:executable\n"
"# → dist/anima-executable/ (staging)\n"
"just install-cli\n"
"# → ~/.anima/standalone/ + ~/.anima/bin/anima\n"
"anima --version\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:153
msgid ""
"Override prefix: `FREEANIMA_INSTALL_PREFIX=/opt/freeanima just install-cli` "
"or `bun scripts/install-cli.ts --prefix /opt/freeanima --skip-build`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/install.md:156
#, no-wrap
msgid "Source (repository)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:159
msgid "For development, unreleased fixes, or running from a git checkout."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/install.md:160
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Clone and install dependencies"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:163
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Prerequisites:** Bun >= 1.3.14 · PostgreSQL (pgvector) · Redis (recommended) · Vault (recommended) · [just](https://github.com/casey/just) (for `just install-cli`)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:164
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima.git\n"
"cd freeanima\n"
"bun install\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/install.md:170
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Run the CLI from the checkout"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:173
msgid ""
"Do **not** symlink source `cli.ts` into a global bin. Use package scripts:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:174
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bun run anima -- --help\n"
"bun run service start --foreground\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:180
msgid ""
"To install a **standalone** binary into an independent prefix (default "
"`~/.anima/standalone`) for a PATH `anima` command:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:181
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"just install-cli\n"
"# ensure ~/.anima/bin is on PATH\n"
"anima --version\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/install.md:187
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Configure and start"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:189
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir -p ~/.anima\n"
"cp config.example.yaml ~/.anima/config.yaml\n"
"# configure database + LLM (see database.md, security.md)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:196
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Dev** (Hub + Vite HMR; never auto-builds Web). Prefer `just dev` for multi-worktree:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:197
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"just dev            # Hub random ≥10000 + Web from :5000; FREEANIMA_URL wires Vite proxy only\n"
"# or two terminals:\n"
"bun run dev:hub     # random ≥10000 (not production 2658); writes ~/.anima/dev-web.token\n"
"FREEANIMA_URL=http://127.0.0.1:<hub-port> bun run dev:web   # default :5000; browser Hub = page origin\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:205
msgid ""
"Browser Web defaults Hub URL to the **page origin** (same in production Hub-"
"hosted `/web` and Vite). Dev injects Service API Token from `dev-web.token` "
"automatically. If `http.tls.enabled` / `DEV_HTTPS=1`, Vite serves HTTPS "
"using `~/.anima/tls` (Hub stays plain HTTP)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:207
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Source deploy** (Hub hosts `/web/*` when `config.yaml` `web.enabled`): build Web first, then start — startup does not run `build:web`. Source-tree `anima` has no `service` command.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:208
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bun run build:web\n"
"bun run dev:hub\n"
"# UI: http://127.0.0.1:2658/web/chat\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/install.md:214
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Development checks"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:216
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bun run check    # typecheck + lint + format + changed unit tests\n"
"bun run test     # full unit + integration (integration may use Docker for temp PG)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:222
msgid ""
"Upgrade manually: `git pull`, `bun install`, then restart the service. "
"`anima upgrade` / `/upgrade` print instructions only."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/install.md:225
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify installation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:228
msgid ""
"Requires the **standalone** `anima` binary (`anima service` is not on the "
"source-tree CLI)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:229
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima service start\n"
"anima token create --subject-id 1 --name bootstrap\n"
"# 将输出的 fa_at_... 填入客户端 Hub 设置\n"
"\n"
"anima service status\n"
"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer <fa_at_...>\" http://127.0.0.1:2658/hub/rpc/v1/status/get | jq '.version, .memory_kb'\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:239
msgid ""
"If status fails, check PostgreSQL connectivity, that migrations completed "
"([`database.md`](database.md#troubleshooting)), and that a valid Service API "
"Token is configured."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/install.md:240
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/guide/install.md:246
msgid ""
"**Security** — Vault / `env()` for secrets, `chmod 700 ~/.anima`, do not "
"expose Console without auth ([`security.md`](security.md))"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/guide/install.md:246
msgid ""
"**Remote access** — Service API Token + LAN / local HTTPS for personal "
"mobile/remote Console ([`remote-access.md`](remote-access.md))"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/guide/install.md:246
msgid ""
"**Database** — backups, extensions, manual migrations if needed "
"([`database.md`](database.md))"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/guide/install.md:246
msgid ""
"**Operations** — start/stop, memory metrics ([`service.md`](service.md))"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: docs/guide/install.md:246
msgid ""
"**Architecture** — memory pipeline, self layer, tools ([`../concepts/"
"architecture.md`](../concepts/architecture.md))"
msgstr ""
